<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Comparison of trainable parameter counts across models and methods. For <span id="A1.T2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_smallcaps">UpSafe℃</span>, we report parameters and epochs in Stage 1 / Stage 2 separately.</figcaption>
